      {
        "id": "AurelionSolQ",
        "name": "Breath of Light",
        "description": "Aurelion Sol channels his dragon breath for a few seconds, damaging the first enemy hit and splashing reduced damage onto nearby enemies. Each second the breath is channeled directly at an enemy will deal bonus damage, which is improved by the amount of Stardust that's been collected. This ability collects Stardust if the target is a champion.",
        "tooltip": "Aurelion Sol breathes starfire for up to 3.25/3.25/3.25/3.25/9999 seconds, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(45/60/75/90/105 + (55% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> per second to the first enemy hit and 50% of the damage to surrounding enemies.<br /><br />Each full second of breath on the same enemy deals a burst of <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/70/80/90/100 + (30% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> plus <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\"> max Health magic damage</span> and absorbs <span style=\"color: #3458eb\">2 Stardust</span> if they are a champion.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability's range is 750.<br />Canceling this Ability within 0.25 seconds of casting it will lock the Ability for 1 second.<br />Minimum mana cost of 30/35/40/45/50 per cast.<br />Percent damage deals a max of <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">300 magic damage</span> against jungle monsters.</span>",
