      {
        "id": "AurelionSolE",
        "name": "Singularity",
        "description": "Aurelion Sol summons a black hole, damaging enemies and slowly pulling them toward its center. This ability grants Stardust each time an enemy dies within the black hole and for each second an enemy champion is caught inside it. The center of the black hole executes enemies who are below a certain percentage of their maximum health. Stardust increases Singularity's area as well as the execution threshold.",
        "tooltip": "Aurelion Sol summons a black hole, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(10/15/20/25/30 + (12% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> per second and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Dragging</span> enemies towards the center for 5 seconds. Enemies in the center below <span>5% max Health</span> die instantly.<br /><br />The black hole absorbs <span style=\"color: #3458eb\">Stardust</span> when enemies die within it and each second an enemy champion is inside.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability's cast range is 750.<br />Lane minions and jungle monsters inside have <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">0 Movement Speed</span>.<br />Epic monsters cannot be executed.<br />Absorbs <span style=\"color: #3458eb\">1 Stardust</span> per second from Champions.<br />Absorbs <span style=\"color: #3458eb\">Stardust</span> from units that die in the black hole:<span>Champions: <span style=\"color: #3458eb\">2 Stardust</span></span><span>Epic monsters: <span style=\"color: #3458eb\">2 Stardust</span></span><span>Large monsters: <span style=\"color: #3458eb\">2 Stardust</span></span><span>Siege minions: <span style=\"color: #3458eb\">2 Stardust</span></span><span>Minions and small monsters: <span style=\"color: #3458eb\">1 Stardust</span></span></span>",
